Note on third-party data: `experiment-data/reference_labels.json` incorporates
property values derived from Open Food Facts (https://world.openfoodfacts.org),
which is separately licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL) for data and
CC BY-SA for images. `experiment-data/images/obj_001.jpg`–`obj_023.jpg` are Open
Food Facts' own product photographs and remain under Open Food Facts' CC BY-SA
license, not this repository's CC BY 4.0 license. See `experiment-data/README.md`
for the specific attribution requirements that apply to that subset of the data
and images. This repository's own CC BY 4.0 license applies to everything else —
code, proofs, worked example, results, documentation, and the 9 authors'-own
photographs in `experiment-data/images/obj_024.jpg`–`obj_032.jpg` — and to the
specific selection and arrangement of the Open Food Facts-derived values recorded
in `reference_labels.json`, without superseding Open Food Facts' own license on
the underlying database or images.
